1
00:00:00,475 --> 00:00:02,475
《You'll never walk alone》

2
00:00:02,840 --> 00:00:09,031
When you walk through a storm

3
00:00:11,202 --> 00:00:18,502
Hold your head up high

4
00:00:18,770 --> 00:00:27,805
And don't be afraid of the dark

5
00:00:32,820 --> 00:00:38,391
At the end of a storm

6
00:00:39,925 --> 00:00:46,375
There's a golden sky

7
00:00:47,790 --> 00:00:58,305
And the sweet silver song of a lark

8
00:01:02,440 --> 00:01:08,440
Walk on through the wind

9
00:01:09,490 --> 00:01:15,965
Walk on through the rain

10
00:01:16,440 --> 00:01:30,100
Though your dreams be tossed and blown

11
00:01:31,335 --> 00:01:33,665
Walk on

12
00:01:34,115 --> 00:01:37,730
Walk on

13
00:01:38,280 --> 00:01:45,590
With hope in your heart

14
